<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">parodies, the &quot;real Song of Australia&quot; (The Advertiser)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1859</span><span class="sg-chain-h">parody</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">My Bougainville</span><span class="sg-chain-h">same melody, as the anthem of the Autonomous Region of Bougainville</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">ANZAC Girls (television series), episode 4, &quot;Love&quot;</span><span class="sg-chain-h">Peter Dawson's recording played, and sung in snatches</span></li></ul></section>
